theway-markdown-core
===================

This crate is a mechanical port of `xai-grok-markdown-core` from the
Grok Build codebase.

Donor
-----
- SpaceXAI (xAI), Grok Build
- Source revision: 5d08d7e
- License: Apache-2.0 (retained; see source file headers and Cargo.toml)

Purpose
-------
Port of Grok Build's exact `pulldown-cmark` configuration: parser options
(GFM / strikethrough / math / tasklists / tables), the single-tilde
strikethrough demotion (`offset_events`), and the markdown analysis
(`analyze`, `MarkdownStats`, `StructuralIssue`). Used by theway's TUI feed
renderer so analysis matches what is actually rendered.

Only mechanical changes were made: package name / prefix
`xai-grok-markdown-core` -> `theway-markdown-core`, and the crate shell
(Cargo.toml) rewritten for theway's workspace. Original copyright headers
in the source files are preserved.
